                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basilutwe bako mbasicinguni, mbeenzinyina ababbi. Boonse balayandisya makulo, balabika myoyo yabo kumalumbu, Tababeteki makani aabamusyaala, aalo makani aamukamufu taamvwigwi kulimbabo.",
          "type": "text",
